# Deploy after HLTV edits

This repo is consumed as `cslivestats-hltv` (symlink from `/Users/Projects/cslivestats/node_modules`). Node loads **`lib/`**, not `src/`.

After **any** source change:

1. `npm run build` in this repo
2. From `/Users/Projects/cslivestats`: `node src/scripts/pm2Restart.js <apps>` (never `pm2 restart --update-env`)

`getMatches` / listing → restart **`hltv`**, `matchesCron`, `updateWorker`. Skipping `hltv` leaves `/getMatches` on the old parser.

`getMatch` / scorebot / `utils` → also `scraperWorker`.
